n its own worktree branched from C41's commit 70b4a920 (on c41-api, itself from C40's 73048f76, C39b's 49a5bac1, C39a's 640103e7 and main's C38 1ff6fe17), so the earlier chunks' gates stayed in scope; scope and diff.patch are measured from 70b4a920. The owner's uncommitted build files (xtask sources, Cargo.lock, the Tauri manifests, the desktop-core version bump, the harness pin, the legacy feature views) are present as uncommitted copies, excluded from scope as the owner's work; the v2 Academy imports no legacy view (AcademyView is not imported; the learner provider and the offline work under features/academy are shared infrastructure until C44). Native acceptance C42-N01..N02 recorded against the rebuilt fixture bundle (native-prepare.json; executable hash bound in native-acceptance.json) with AX trees, self-captures and the measured layout matrix under evidence/C42/screens, against the synthetic Academy endpoint (academy_server.py) with the device sign-in granted. The owner's dependency amendment of 2026-10-30 applies (approved in the owner's words, \"Dependency amendment approved\"): P09 chunks are reviewed on their own worktrees from each predecessor's pre-gate commit; predecessor remediation is integrated by the merge chain and validated by the P09 phase review, so a chunk's review takes the predecessor's record as it stands.",
